iased rating listed on platforms is correlated with the true unbiased rating and by including more information from online reviews as input features of our model we can get a reasonably well\u00a0estimate of the average unbiased ratings. We propose and compare several predictive models to estimate unbiased average ratings and show how textual data can play a critical role in enhancing the predictive power. Our results can help review aggregation platforms to determine mechanisms to cut down the bias on their platforms and can benefit businesses and consumers on their platform to access a fairer metric for service quality.","topics":[],"score":2250,"global_rank":140187},{"name":"temilaj/langgraph-playground","owner":"temilaj","html_url":"https://github.com/temilaj/langgraph-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2250,"global_rank":140188},{"name":"Phil-Hills/fha-hmda-analytics","owner":"Phil-Hills","html_url":"https://github.com/Phil-Hills/fha-hmda-analytics","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2250,"global_rank":140213},{"name":"Heidijvr/MMAEvolution","owner":"Heidijvr","html_url":"https://github.com/Heidijvr/MMAEvolution","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Examining the evolution of MMA through analysis of UFC fights 2010 to 2021","topics":[],"score":2250,"global_rank":140264},{"name":"sealablab/Simple-Slider-App","owner":"sealablab","html_url":"https://github.com/sealablab/Simple-Slider-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2250,"global_rank":140271},{"name":"smileshey/LongerTomorrow","owner":"smileshey","html_url":"https://github.com/smileshey/LongerTomorrow","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2